### Get all images.  Each request **MUST** be delimited by a triple hash
# This is a comment
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images

### Get one image by ID (replace with a real _id from the request above)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images/69aec617e80ae6ba10cca761

### A second example.  Each request **MUST** be delimited by a triple hash
POST http://localhost:3000/api/test
Content-Type: application/json # Content-Type header is a must if you're sending JSON
# Request body separated from headers by newline

{ "a": 1, "b": 2 }
### Rename image - success (replace with a real _id)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69aec617e80ae6ba10cca761
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Updated image name" }

### Rename image - bad request (missing required name field)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69aec617e80ae6ba10cca761
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Wrong field" }

### Rename image - not found (invalid ObjectId format)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/not-a-valid-object-id
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Some name" }

### Rename image - content too large (> 100 chars)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69aec617e80ae6ba10cca761
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "12345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901" }

### Register user - success
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer PLEASEWORK
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "new_user_1", "email": "new_user_1@example.com", "password": "mySecretPassword" }

### Register user - conflict (same username as above)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "new_user_1", "email": "different@example.com", "password": "mySecretPassword" }

### Register user - bad request (missing password)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "new_user_2", "email": "new_user_2@example.com" }

### Login user - success
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "new_user_1", "password": "mySecretPassword" }

### Login user - fail (Unauthorized - wrong password)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "new_user_1", "password": "wrongPassword" }

### Rename image - forbidden (user does not own the image)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69aec617e80ae6ba10cca761
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6Im5ld191c2VyXzEiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzMzNDEzMTUsImV4cCI6MTc3MzQyNzcxNX0.iJcPBdhCg_ILuhS1LcPzrX7Tl8YNtdLZT-xpSyB2jeo
Content-Type: application/json

